   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sending an email",
     "texto": [
      "**Emne** means «subject» and **vedlegg**, «attachment». In Norwegian you say **legge ved et dokument** to indicate that a document is attached."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Short messages",
     "texto": [
      "**Beskjed** is a notice or message. **Motta** means to receive; **mottaker**, recipient. **Snart** was already learned in an earlier chapter."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
